MzQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5796634?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9", "html_url": "https://github.com/laurb9", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/laurb9/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-18T01:56:22Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-18T02:00:27Z", "body": "The image is there now (pulling on MacOS) - was fixed in https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/pull/6124\n\n```\ndocker pull nousresearch/hermes-agent:latest\nlatest: Pulling from nousresearch/hermes-agent\nDigest: sha256:c47d282991983778e9490949a3c2b014a2428ce505ea74bf48aa7c0e0d65b03f\ndocker.io/nousresearch/hermes-agent:latest\n\ndocker inspect nousresearch/hermes-agent | grep Arch\n        \"Architecture\": \"arm64\",\n```\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4272364986/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 1, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4667951337", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/5554#issuecomment-4667951337", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/5554", "id": 4667951337, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFjtI6Q", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-10T08:03:33Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-10T08:03:33Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=5554 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nThanks for the request, and thanks to everyone who chimed in with workarounds!\n\nThis is now fixed \u2014 ARM64/v8 support was added in PR #6124 (`18140199c`) and shipped in release **v2026.4.13**.\n\n- CI now uses `docker/setup-qemu-action` for cross-compilation and publishes a multi-arch manifest covering `linux/amd64` and `linux/arm64`.\n- Community member @laurb9 confirmed on 2026-04-18 that `docker pull nousresearch/hermes-agent:latest` correctly pulls the arm64 image on Apple Silicon without `--platform` flags.\n- Raspberry Pi (arm64/v8) and Docker-on-macOS (M1/M2/M3) should both work natively now.\n\nClosing as implemented. Please re-open if you hit any remaining issues with the published image.\n\n*\u2014 automated hermes-sweeper review*\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4667951337/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]